Subject: [PATCH 03/10] fix(desktop): harden Open Design theme bridge

Repairs S3a's rejected head: dark mode was rendering theme.colors
instead of theme.darkColors, the five inline-styled accent vars could
never beat Open Design's own runtime style, the theme rule matched a
bare :root instead of Hermes's own marker, the origin gate accepted a
same-origin blob: candidate, executeJavaScript's resolved failure
shape was ignored, and Open Design's forced data-theme='light'
re-stamp had no defense. Also adds a validated optional host-geometry
snapshot mapped to Open Design's radius/shadow vars, and the missing
--terminal-muted-fg token.
